{"name":"Crème Fraîche","hex":"#eceee6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"crème fraîche","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A slightly soured thick cream (generally less sour than sour cream)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche"}],"entries":[{"title":"Crème fraîche","blocks":[{"text":"Crème fraîche is a dairy product similar to sour cream; it is a soured cream containing 10–45% butterfat, with a pH of approximately 4.5. It is soured with a bacterial culture. European labeling regulations specify the two ingredients must be cream and bacterial culture. It is served over fruit and baked goods, as well as being added to soups and sauces. It is used in a variety of other recipes. Sour cream is a similar foodstuff, except that crème fraîche is less sour and has a higher fat content. Sour cream may contain thickening agents not permitted in crème fraîche in many jurisdictions."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Cr%C3%A8me_d%27Isigny_2.JPG/330px-Cr%C3%A8me_d%27Isigny_2.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche"},{"title":"Crème Fraîche (South Park)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Crème Fraîche\" is the fourteenth episode and season finale of the fourteenth season of American animated television series South Park, and the 209th episode of the series overall. It was first broadcast on Comedy Central in the United States on November 17, 2010. \"Crème Fraîche\" was written and directed by series co-creator Trey Parker."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cr%C3%A8me_Fra%C3%AEche_(South_Park)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche.jpg/500px-Cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche.jpg/500px-Cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Containers of crème fraîche","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Buttern_2012_Bo-E4-1244.jpg/500px-Buttern_2012_Bo-E4-1244.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Buttern_2012_Bo-E4-1244.jpg/500px-Buttern_2012_Bo-E4-1244.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Separation of milk using a traditional dairy centrifuge by a farmer","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AButtern_2012_Bo-E4-1244.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Chilled_asparagus_soup.jpg/500px-Chilled_asparagus_soup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Chilled_asparagus_soup.jpg/1280px-Chilled_asparagus_soup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Chilled_asparagus_soup.jpg/500px-Chilled_asparagus_soup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Chilled asparagus soup with crème fraîche and pink peppercorn","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChilled_asparagus_soup.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Raspberries_with_cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche_and_sugar.jpg/500px-Raspberries_with_cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche_and_sugar.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Raspberries_with_cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche_and_sugar.jpg/1280px-Raspberries_with_cr%C3%A8me_fra%C3%AEche_and_sugar.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content